Work with YouTrack issues

<bold>Usage:</>
  <accent>ytrack issue</> <command> [flags]
  <accent>ytrack issue</> [command]

<bold>Available Commands:</>
  <accent>attach     </> Attach files to an issue
  <accent>command    </> Apply a YouTrack command to one or more issues
  <accent>comment    </> Add a comment to an issue
  <accent>create     </> Create an issue
  <accent>edit       </> Edit an issue
  <accent>list       </> List issues
  <accent>view       </> Show an issue

<bold>Flags:</>
  <accent>-h, --help</>   help for issue

<bold>Global Flags:</>
      <accent>--debug</>       Log HTTP requests to stderr with credentials redacted
      <accent>--host</><dim> host</>   YouTrack host or service URL to use
      <accent>--no-color</>    Disable color output

<dim>Use "ytrack issue [command] --help" for more information about a command.</>
